--
-- Description:
--    Port of **18f4620_compiler_regression_crc.jal** to PIC32
--    (@sim_validate / QEMU).  Shared body
--    **`tests/_regression_crc_body.jal`**: CRC16-CCITT over
--    several messages incl. incremental updates, plus a bubble sort
--    with a pinned sorted image and sum invariant.
--
-- Notes:
--    ./bin/jalv3-x86-64 -s 'lib;tests' tests/pic32/32mz1024efh064_crc_regression.jal
--
